  "contentHtml": "<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"395\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<p>In this space on Saturdays, I <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/roundup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">do a weekly round-up</a> of sorts: Sifting through what I wrote that you might have missed during the week, what I’ve been reading and watching myself, and some other fun things that have been going on.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/subscribe?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h4>📝 What I did this week</h4>\n<p><em>Here are the things I wrote or podcasted about during the previous week, sorted in descending order by quality, popularity and/or current relevance.</em></p>\n<p><strong>📊 My <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/updating-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Odds/Models</a>: <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nfl-odds-tracker-and-elo-ratings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NFL </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-mlb-elo-power-ratings-playoff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>MLB </span></a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-wnba-elo-team-power-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>WNBA</span> </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-nba-elo-forecast-and-player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NBA</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-nhl-team-elo-power-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NHL </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-college-football-odds-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CFB</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-english-premier-league-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">EPL</a> | <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nascar-cup-series-driver-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>NASCAR</span></a></strong></p>\n<ul><li><p>Check out the <strong><a href=\"https://view.newsletters.yahoo.net/messages/1793360738484aa845bd911d1/raw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo! Sports AM newsletter</a></strong> for my various charts and other contributions, including…</p><ul><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://view.newsletters.yahoo.net/messages/179457342702653e4de7df894/raw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Two paths to MVP</a>:</strong></p><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!AHBN!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6191944-26ed-4969-9ea1-bdca20a87477_2400x2310.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!AHBN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc6191944-26ed-4969-9ea1-bdca20a87477_2400x2310.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1401\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://view.newsletters.yahoo.net/messages/1794317575520d8b33ca109f3/raw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Brown vs. Boston reunion</a></strong>:</p><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!xEIR!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F97285558-5562-40c3-9ff1-030192d98133_1366x1110.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!xEIR!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F97285558-5562-40c3-9ff1-030192d98133_1366x1110.png\" width=\"1366\" height=\"1110\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://view.newsletters.yahoo.net/messages/17942341999820bb19959d36a/raw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The agony of defeat… on repeat</a>:</strong></p><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!58fA!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2c5d4803-4991-4f37-9725-0a70933de70d_1240x1030.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!58fA!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2c5d4803-4991-4f37-9725-0a70933de70d_1240x1030.png\" width=\"1240\" height=\"1030\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure></li></ul></li><li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/joe-buck-troy-aikman-and-the-end\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Joe Buck, Troy Aikman and the End of the NFL’s Greatest Broadcasting Dynasty</a></strong> – With reported behind-the-scenes tensions looming ahead of their upcoming Super Bowl broadcast, I looked back at Joe Buck and Troy Aikman’s 25-year run to see how the longest-running booth duo in NFL history stacks up against all-time sports media dynasties.</p></li><li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/its-been-41-years-since-baseball\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">It’s Been 41 Years Since Baseball Has Seen a Pair of Cy Young Winners Like This</a></strong> – With Cam Schlittler and Jacob Misiorowski sweeping the AL and NL Cy Young Awards in each of their sophomore campaigns, I looked at the unique historical nature of two second-year CYA winners and what their instant dominance says about the current state of MLB pitching.</p></li><li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-jaguars-are-partying-like-its\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Jaguars Are Partying Like It’s 1999</a></strong> – Off to their best start since the franchise’s late-1990s golden era under Mark Brunell and Tom Coughlin, I analyzed Jacksonville’s <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/ring-shopping\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">aggressive deadline trading</a> around Trevor Lawrence as the Jags push to capitalize on what has been a rarity for the franchise: a true championship window opening.</p></li><li><p>🏆 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-playoff-industrial-complex-is\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Playoff-Industrial Complex Is Eating Sports Alive</a></strong> – As the College Football Playoff doubles in size to 24 teams and March Madness expands to 76 (!), I examined how recent, unchecked postseason expansion across major sports is detracting from regular-season drama in pursuit of endless, and increasingly meaningless, playoff “event” programming.</p></li><li><p>🏀 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/jaylen-brown-gave-up-shots-to-make\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Jaylen Brown Gave Up Shots to Make the Sixers an Offensive Superteam. So Why Is Defense Carrying Them?</a></strong> – Ahead of Brown’s first matchup against Boston since his offseason trade, I examined how his reduced Usage Rate has fit within Philadelphia’s star-heavy roster — and why the Sixers were actually relying on defense (and some luck) for their record more than an explosive offense.</p></li><li><p>🏁 <strong><a href=\"https://www.nascar.com/news-media/2026/11/12/analysis-kyle-larson-hasnt-had-the-same-championship-season-twice/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kyle Larson hasn’t had the same championship season twice</a> </strong>- Following Kyle Larson securing another  NASCAR Cup Series crown at Homestead-Miami Speedway, I broke down how his latest title run differed statistically (and strategically) from his previous championship seasons, and where his career can soar from here.</p><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!BeVv!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdae82661-4ee0-4d94-8a63-03fccb0cfaef_1440x714.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!BeVv!,w_2400,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdae82661-4ee0-4d94-8a63-03fccb0cfaef_1440x714.png\" width=\"738\" height=\"366\" data-size=\"large\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><ul><li><p>🏁🎙️ <strong><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/6fGbY8LK60e5iP0gDMwMH2?si=Fg2nZXfiRIC9h9It8Nk8Tw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Podracing: Closing Time</a></strong> - In the 2026 season finale of , <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tyler-lauletta-b0399667/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Lauletta</a> and I broke down Ryan Blaney’s win at Homestead, Denny Hamlin and Christopher Bell’s missed chances, the anticlimactic way Kyle Larson’s title was announced, the meaning of Larson’s championship and his future among the GOATS. Then we pivoted to talk about our favorite moments and features of the 2026 season (including the Chase system), and closed the book on the year with a very too-early look at the 2027 Daytona favorites. </p></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h4>📊 Charts of the week:</h4>\n<p>Here were some of my favorite viz items of the week from <em><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/scoreboard-newsletter-archives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Scoreboard</a></strong></em>, my daily newsletter for <a href=\"https://sherwood.news/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sherwood News</a>… </p>\n<p>🏀<em><strong> On the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/224604816/find-the-edge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NBA’s endless race to the bottom</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!_msk!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5eea9844-faf3-4cdd-842d-78967aea5de8_1900x1186.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!_msk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5eea9844-faf3-4cdd-842d-78967aea5de8_1900x1186.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"909\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<p><strong>🏈</strong><em><strong> On <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/224757125/find-the-edge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">curses of the Madden variety</a> (or otherwise)…</strong></em></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!bf2d!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a098226-f7ac-4807-909c-9237bf0f1d7c_1900x1312.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!bf2d!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a098226-f7ac-4807-909c-9237bf0f1d7c_1900x1312.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1005\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<p><strong>🏈</strong><em><strong> On the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/224455400/chart-of-the-day\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">curious rankings placement</a> of 2-loss SEC teams…</strong></em></p>\n<div></div>\n<p>🏈<strong> </strong><em><strong>On <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/ring-shopping\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">more NFL deadline trades</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!SKni!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F188a0650-0a3d-42bd-80e0-417fbe2bd4f8_1860x1596.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!SKni!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F188a0650-0a3d-42bd-80e0-417fbe2bd4f8_1860x1596.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1249\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<p>🏀<strong> </strong><em><strong>On the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/224310642/chart-of-the-day\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NBA’s leading Revenge Games</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<p><em><br>Subscribe to <strong>Scoreboard</strong> by <strong><a href=\"https://join.sherwood.news/scoreboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clicking here</a></strong>!</em></p>\n<h4>👀 Some interesting things I read/watched this week</h4>\n<p><em>A collection of articles (with a heavy focus on my fellow Substackers), videos and other media that I enjoyed and/or found thought-provoking over the past week. I don’t always 100% agree with or endorse what’s linked here… but that’s also sort of the point.</em></p>\n<ul><li><p>📌🏀 <strong><a href=\"https://www.burdsofafeather.com/p/my-worst-sports-take-ben-simmons?utm_source=post-email-title